  "citation": "Neftel A; Friedli H; Moor E; Lotscher H; Oeschger H; Siegenthaler U; Stauffer B (1997): Historical Carbon Dioxide Record from the Siple Station Ice Core (1734-1983). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC); Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.010",
